{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0648"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge technology/transport","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/technology__transport.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",750],["-","automobile,"],["+","automobile."],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","Its"],["=",1],["-","Bertha"],["+","inventor"],["=",1],["-","Benz's"],["+","hesitated"],["=",1],["-","106-kilometre"],["+","to"],["=",1],["-","drive"],["+","show"],["=",1],["-","to"],["+","it"],["=",1],["-","Pforzheim"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","public, so "],["=",2],["+","August "],["=",2],["-","was"],["+","Bertha"],["=",1],["-","its"],["+","Benz,"],["=",1],["+","his wife and financial partner, took the car without telling him and drove it with her two teenage sons 106 kilometres from Mannheim to her home town of Pforzheim, buying fuel at a pharmacy on the way – the "],["=",2],["+","successful "],["=",2],["-","test."],["+","journey in the history of the automobile. In 1926 Benz & Cie. merged with the Daimler-Motoren-Gesellschaft, and the name of the inventor of the automobile lives on in the brand Mercedes-Benz."],["=",120],["+","\n| 1888 | First long-distance car journey | Bertha Benz |"],["=",70]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",718],["-","Automobil,"],["+","Automobil."],["=",1],["+","Sein Erfinder zögerte, ihn öffentlich vorzuführen, "],["=",2],["+","so nahm "],["=",2],["-","Benz'"],["+","Benz,"],["=",1],["+","seine Frau und Geldgeberin, im August 1888 den Wagen, ohne ihm etwas zu sagen, und fuhr mit ihren beiden halbwüchsigen Söhnen "],["=",4],["-","lange"],["+","von"],["=",1],["-","Fahrt"],["+","Mannheim"],["=",1],["-","nach"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","Pforzheim"],["+","ihre"],["=",1],["-","im"],["+","Heimatstadt"],["=",1],["-","Jahr"],["+","Pforzheim,"],["=",1],["-","1888"],["+","wobei"],["=",1],["-","war"],["+","sie"],["=",1],["-","seine"],["+","unterwegs"],["=",1],["+","in einer Apotheke Benzin kaufte – die "],["=",2],["-","Fernfahrt."],["+","erfolgreiche Fernfahrt in der Geschichte des Automobils. 1926 fusionierte Benz & Cie. mit der Daimler-Motoren-Gesellschaft, und der Name des Erfinders des Automobils lebt in der Marke Mercedes-Benz fort."],["=",118],["+","\n| 1888 | Erste Fernfahrt mit dem Auto | Bertha Benz |"],["=",64]]}]},
